       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The process of acquisition and distribution of new books for 2010 was finalized in February 2010.  The distribution of free schoolbooks is done with the minimu                                                    m number of intermediaries and a major achievementwas the reduction of the ille                                                    gal selling of books. It is now underway theprocurement for the books to be dis                                                    tributed in 2011.</narrative>
